{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 6,
  "name": "天水讼",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00816",
              "text": "讼。有孚，窒惕，中吉，终凶。利见大人，不利涉大川。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00816",
                "bodyParagraph": 752
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00817",
              "text": "象曰：天与水违行，讼。君子以作事谋始。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00817",
                "bodyParagraph": 753
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0011"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00819",
              "text": "讼卦：虽有利可图(获得俘虏)，但要警惕戒惧。其事中间吉利，后来凶险。占筮得此爻，有利于会见贵族王公，不利于涉水渡河。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00819",
                "bodyParagraph": 755
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00820",
              "text": "《象辞》说：上卦为乾，乾为天；下卦为坎，坎为水，天水隔绝，流向相背，事理乖舛，这是讼卦的卦象。君子观此卦象，以杜绝争讼为意，从而在谋事之初必须慎之又慎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00820",
                "bodyParagraph": 756
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "《断易天机》解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00822",
              "text": "讼卦乾上坎下，为离宫游魂卦。上乾为刚，下坎为险，一方刚强，一方阴险，必然产生争论，因此多有不吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00822",
                "bodyParagraph": 758
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00824",
              "text": "天高水深，达远不亲；慎谋退守，敬畏无凶。 得此卦者，身心不安，事多不顺，与他人多争诉之事，宜修身养性，谨慎处事。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00824",
                "bodyParagraph": 760
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00826",
              "text": "时运：功名受阻，不宜树敌。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00826",
                "bodyParagraph": 762
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00827",
              "text": "财运：开始谨慎，终可获利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00827",
                "bodyParagraph": 763
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00828",
              "text": "家宅：君子必求淑女。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00828",
                "bodyParagraph": 764
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00829",
              "text": "身体：预防胜于治疗。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00829",
                "bodyParagraph": 765
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "传统解卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00831",
              "text": "这个卦是异卦（下坎上乾）相叠。同需卦相反，互为“综卦”。乾为刚健，坎为险陷。刚与险，健与险，彼此反对，定生争讼。争讼非善事，务必慎重戒惧。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00831",
                "bodyParagraph": 767
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00832",
              "text": "大象：乾天升于上，坎水降于下，相背而行而起讼。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00832",
                "bodyParagraph": 768
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00833",
              "text": "运势：事与愿违，凡事不顺，小人加害，宜防陷阱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00833",
                "bodyParagraph": 769
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00834",
              "text": "事业：起初顺利，有利可图，继而受挫，务必警惕，慎之又慎，不得固执已见，极力避免介入诉讼纠纷的争执之中。与其这样，不如退而让人，求得化解，安于正理，可免除意外之灾。陷入争讼，即使获胜，最后还得失去，得不偿失。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00834",
                "bodyParagraph": 770
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00835",
              "text": "经商：和气生财，吃亏是福，切勿追求不义之财。商业谈判应坚持公正、公平、互利的原则，尽量避免发生冲突。这样便会有好结果。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00835",
                "bodyParagraph": 771
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00836",
              "text": "求名：不利。自己尚缺乏竞争实力，应坚守纯正，隐忍自励，自强自勉，切莫逞强。依靠有地位的人的帮助，及早渡过难关。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00836",
                "bodyParagraph": 772
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00837",
              "text": "婚恋：虽不尽人意，倒也般配，彼此理解，未尝不可。双方应以温和的方式处理生活。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00837",
                "bodyParagraph": 773
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00838",
              "text": "决策：争强好胜，不安于现状，为改变命运和超越他人而奋斗。头脑聪颖，反应敏捷，有贵人相助。但缺乏持之以恒的毅力，容易露出锋芒，得罪他人，带来诉讼之灾。宜承认现实，顺其自然，知足，适可而止。接受教训，引以为戒，可功成名就。第六卦哲学含义 讼卦，这个卦是异卦相叠，下卦为坎，上卦为乾。乾为刚健，坎为险陷。刚与险，健与陷，彼此反对，定生争讼。争讼非善事，务必慎重戒惧。讼卦位于需卦之后，同需卦相反，互为“综卦”。《序卦》之中这样说道：“饮食必有讼，故受之以讼。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00838",
                "bodyParagraph": 774
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00839",
              "text": "”人与人之间因为争取需求而发生诉讼。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00839",
                "bodyParagraph": 775
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00840",
              "text": "《象》曰：天与水违行，讼;君子以作事谋始。 讼卦上卦为乾为天为阳，其性质向上，下卦为坎为水为阳，其性质向下，两卦同性相斥，并且天往上升，水往下流，目标相违背，这便是讼卦的卦象。这就好比人们各自怀着私心，都为自己的利益着想，思想不能统一起来。所以人们在争夺利益的同时，便会引发争斗，到头来只有通过沂讼进行解决了。 讼卦之象，有口舌二字，为祸端起因;山下有睡虎，主有惊恐;文书在云中，主远而未兴讼;人立虎下，主到尾有惊。占者若得之，宜慎出入。此为俊鹰逐兔之卦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00840",
                "bodyParagraph": 776
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00843",
              "text": "初六。不永所事，小有言，终吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00843",
                "bodyParagraph": 779
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00844",
              "text": "象曰：不永所事，讼不可长也；虽小有言，其辩明也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00844",
                "bodyParagraph": 780
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00846",
              "text": "初六：做事不能持之以恒，稍有过错，最后还是吉利的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00846",
                "bodyParagraph": 782
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00847",
              "text": "《象辞》说：做事不能持之以恒，说明官司不可能长久打下去。虽然稍有过错，但争讼双方的是非曲直终将辨别清楚。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00847",
                "bodyParagraph": 783
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00849",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，会生起是非，但终吉。有病者，不药而愈。做官的会遭诽谤，但会不辩自明。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00849",
                "bodyParagraph": 785
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00851",
              "text": "时运：不会久困，终可出名。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00851",
                "bodyParagraph": 787
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00852",
              "text": "财运：及时售出，口舌无碍。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00852",
                "bodyParagraph": 788
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00853",
              "text": "家宅：有些争议，分辨明白即可。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00853",
                "bodyParagraph": 789
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00854",
              "text": "身体：初病可愈，久病则凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00854",
                "bodyParagraph": 790
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00856",
              "text": "初六爻动变得周易第10卦：天泽履。这个卦是异卦（下兑上乾）相叠，乾为天，兑为泽，以天喻君，以泽喻民，原文：“履（踩）虎尾，不咥（咬）人”。因此，结果吉利。君上民下，各得其位。兑柔遇乾刚，所履危。履意为实践，卦义是脚踏实地的向前进取的意思。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00856",
                "bodyParagraph": 792
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00858",
              "text": "讼卦代表争端，初六可谓是开始阶段，阴爻居于柔位，顺从的性格表示其不会把这种争讼之事长久地进行下去，可能会小有一些口舌之争，但是最后会吉祥。占得此爻的人，应该学习一下蔺相如的做法。人与人之间发生矛盾，这是难免的。矛盾发生后，按此爻爻义所示，最好的办法是尽快消解矛盾，达到和解，使斗争结束于“有言”的状态，而不宜将斗争扩大和继续下去。占得此爻的人，别人说一句错话、办了一件错事，偶而说说可以，只有这样才能吉祥，不要一直纠缠不放，否则会惹出事端。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00858",
                "bodyParagraph": 794
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00859",
              "text": "占得讼卦的人，因为讼卦的内卦为坎，喻指此人存在着自负的性格，虽然有与人合作的愿望，但往往傲慢不恭，好为人师，从而引发争端。占得此爻，要注意克制一下自己。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00859",
                "bodyParagraph": 795
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "九二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00862",
              "text": "九二。不克讼，归而逋，其邑人三百户无眚。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00862",
                "bodyParagraph": 798
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00863",
              "text": "象曰：不克讼，归而逋也；自下讼上，患至掇也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00863",
                "bodyParagraph": 799
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00865",
              "text": "九二：讼事失败，归到采邑，三百户奴隶逃亡。没有大的灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00865",
                "bodyParagraph": 801
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00866",
              "text": "《象辞》说：讼事失败，逃窜回家，这是躲避反讼。小官与大官争讼，败讼而归，势在必然。幸好灾难没有进一步扩大。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00866",
                "bodyParagraph": 802
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00868",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，平安无事。做官的会有食邑之荣。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00868",
                "bodyParagraph": 804
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00870",
              "text": "时运：退而隐居，可保无害。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00870",
                "bodyParagraph": 806
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00871",
              "text": "财运：小有耗损，不必多虑。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00871",
                "bodyParagraph": 807
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00872",
              "text": "家宅：不宜婚嫁。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00872",
                "bodyParagraph": 808
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00873",
              "text": "身体：在外染病，回家调养。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00873",
                "bodyParagraph": 809
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00875",
              "text": "九二爻动变得周易第12卦：天地否。这个卦是异卦（下坤上乾）相叠，其结构同泰卦相反，系阳气上升，阴气下降，天地不交，万物不通。它们彼此为“综卦”，表明泰极而否，否极泰来，互为因果。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00875",
                "bodyParagraph": 811
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00877",
              "text": "讼卦第二爻爻辞释义 克：胜也。“克讼”类似于胜诉的意思。逋：逃。眚：自身原因造成的祸 邑：是大夫的封地。三百邑是下大夫的领地。本爻的意思是：争讼没有成功，回来躲避，其采邑的三百户人口没有灾害。从卦象上看，九二属于阳爻居于阴位，虽然失位，但是得中。在本卦之中， 只有九二与九五为阳爻，九五以阳爻居阳位，是尊位、大人位，居君位而中正，九二却居于下卦的第二爻，身份地位明显低于九五。九二与九五是敌应关系，两方因某事发生了争讼。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00877",
                "bodyParagraph": 813
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00878",
              "text": "九二当然不是九五的敌手，但是其自恃己见，以为不管对方势力多大，官位多高，只要自己有理，就可以争讼一番。但要知道，下不能犯上，地不能逼天。九五为尊，九二与九五“叫板”，属于以下犯上，在当时的集权制的社会中，这是自取祸患，明显地打不赢这场官司的。根据卦像来看，下卦为坎，坎代表着危险，而九二正处于坎卦正中，处于危险之中，所以官司对其不利。好在九二认清了形势，没有一直敌对下去，而是选择了躲避，逃回了家乡，这样勉强没事，并且邑人也没有受到牵连。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00878",
                "bodyParagraph": 814
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00879",
              "text": "占得本爻的人，若是正在争讼之中，要看清形势，若是形势对自己不利，对方占有明显的优势，就要先采取躲避的办法以免灾祸。可以找一处休闲地方散散心，暂避几日，是非便会不争自散。所以此爻主要告知人们的就是：适时地躲避。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00879",
                "bodyParagraph": 815
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "六三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00882",
              "text": "六三。食旧德，贞厉，终吉。或从王事，无成。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00882",
                "bodyParagraph": 818
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00883",
              "text": "象曰：食旧德，从上吉也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00883",
                "bodyParagraph": 819
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00885",
              "text": "六三：依赖先人遗业过活。卜问得险兆，但最后是吉利的。但是，如果服务于王事，谋取利禄，却不会成功。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00885",
                "bodyParagraph": 821
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00886",
              "text": "《象辞》说：依赖先人遗业过活，因为六三爻象表明，居于九四之下，只有凭借祖上余荫才获吉利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00886",
                "bodyParagraph": 822
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00888",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，宜保持常态，则无灾难。做官的宜谨守常职，晋升无望。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00888",
                "bodyParagraph": 824
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00890",
              "text": "时运：谨守旧业，求仕无成。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00890",
                "bodyParagraph": 826
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00891",
              "text": "财运：固守家产，终可得利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00891",
                "bodyParagraph": 827
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00892",
              "text": "家宅：不宜另建新居。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00892",
                "bodyParagraph": 828
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00893",
              "text": "身体：按原医师指示为宜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00893",
                "bodyParagraph": 829
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00895",
              "text": "六三爻动变得周易第44卦：天风姤。这个卦是异卦（下巽上乾）相叠。乾为天，巽为风。天下有风，吹遍大地，阴阳交合，万物茂盛。姤（gǒu）卦与夬卦相反，互为“综卦”。姤即媾，阴阳相遇。但五阳一阴，不能长久相处。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00895",
                "bodyParagraph": 831
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00897",
              "text": "食：饮食之意，引申为喜好、保持。旧德：指自己原有的功德，一种祖先留下的功德。“食旧德”是指保持旧有的功德，或者是指享用祖先的余荫，也就是“吃老本”之意。这句爻辞有两种解释：一是指享用祖先的余荫，守住正固，会有危险，最后吉祥，或者跟君王做事，没有成就，二是指安享旧有俸禄，守正道，虽然占卜遇到危险的兆头，最终也是吉利的，即使为国家君王立下大功，也不自居其成。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00897",
                "bodyParagraph": 833
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00898",
              "text": "占得此爻者，还要注意不可长久地吃老本，这种老本可能是指祖辈留下的财产或是功德，也可能是指你过去的人脉关系，应该认真地看一下当前的形势，严格地要求自己，在维持过去的财产和人脉关系的同时，还要去开创新的事业，建立新的人脉关系。六三爻与世无争，可以靠祖宗留下的余荫生活，不与人争，自然吉祥了。六三爻与上九爻相应，上九为宗庙之位，所以有六三受益于宗庙的卦象。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00898",
                "bodyParagraph": 834
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "九四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00901",
              "text": "九四。不克讼，复即命，渝安贞，吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00901",
                "bodyParagraph": 837
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00902",
              "text": "象曰：复即命，渝安贞，吉，不失也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00902",
                "bodyParagraph": 838
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00904",
              "text": "九四：讼事失败，败讼回家，服从判决。卜问平安，得吉利之兆。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00904",
                "bodyParagraph": 840
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00905",
              "text": "《象辞》说：败讼回家，服从判决，安守本分，不失正道。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00905",
                "bodyParagraph": 841
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00907",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，会转危为安。做官的会闲中复职。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00907",
                "bodyParagraph": 843
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00909",
              "text": "时运：转危为安。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00909",
                "bodyParagraph": 845
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00910",
              "text": "财运：合作不成，反是好事。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00910",
                "bodyParagraph": 846
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00911",
              "text": "家宅：改婚不失其道。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00911",
                "bodyParagraph": 847
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00912",
              "text": "身体：有凶险，改变生活方式则吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00912",
                "bodyParagraph": 848
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00914",
              "text": "九四爻动变得周易第59卦：风水涣。这个卦是异卦（下坎上巽）相叠。风在水上行，推波助澜，四方流溢。涣，水流流散之意。象征组织和人心涣散，必须用积极的手段和方法克服，战胜弊端，挽救涣散，转危为安。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00914",
                "bodyParagraph": 850
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00916",
              "text": "复：指恢复。命：有命运的含义。“复即命”，恢复到原来的命运状态。渝：指改变。本爻的爻义是指：争讼没有成功，返回到自己原来的状态，安于现状，坚守正道，吉祥。从卦象上看，九四已经进入上卦，并且属于刚爻居于阴位，失位且不居中，过于刚健好胜，不得人心。九四明白自己的过错之后，改变与人好争的性格，从而获得吉祥。占得此爻者，在争执、官司上不能胜诉。当出现这种结果时，虽然心里可能觉得不满意，甚至不服气，怒心冲冲，但是，要克制一下自己，接受这种结果。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00916",
                "bodyParagraph": 852
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00917",
              "text": "回归到正常的生活轨道上，不要再因为官司或争执而耽误了正常的生活和工作，也不要为了发泄不满做出伤害他人的举动，不要想着去报复对方，应接受法律的判决，并认为这都是命运的安排，回到家继续自己以前的生活，这样才能吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00917",
                "bodyParagraph": 853
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "九五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00920",
              "text": "九五。讼，元吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00920",
                "bodyParagraph": 856
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00921",
              "text": "象曰：讼，元吉，以中正也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00921",
                "bodyParagraph": 857
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00923",
              "text": "九五：争讼，筮遇此爻，大吉大利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00923",
                "bodyParagraph": 859
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00924",
              "text": "《象辞》说：争讼而大吉大利，因为九五之爻居上卦的中位，像人守中正之道。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00924",
                "bodyParagraph": 860
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00926",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，经营、谋事、求财皆大吉。做官的会受到重用。读书人会获得佳绩。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00926",
                "bodyParagraph": 862
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00928",
              "text": "时运：以正求进，必可大显。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00928",
                "bodyParagraph": 864
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00929",
              "text": "财运：公平经营，取得正财。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00929",
                "bodyParagraph": 865
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00930",
              "text": "家宅：与富贵人结婚。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00930",
                "bodyParagraph": 866
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00931",
              "text": "身体：吐纳之术保健康。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00931",
                "bodyParagraph": 867
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00933",
              "text": "九五爻动变得周易第64卦：火水未济。这个卦是异卦（下坎上离）相叠。离为火，坎为水。火上水下，火势压倒水势，救火大功未成，故称未济。《周易》以乾坤二卦为始，以既济、未济二卦为终，充分反映了变化发展的思想。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00933",
                "bodyParagraph": 869
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00935",
              "text": "讼卦第五爻爻辞释义元吉：大吉。 本爻的爻义是：官司得到了公正的判决，大吉。 此爻是讼卦的第五爻，占得此爻的人，若是打官司，必大获全胜。胜诉的原因是遇到了公正的法官，幸逢贵人。在讼卦之中，九五这一爻属于阳爻居刚位，正是得位，这表示大人得位，以公正严明的态度处理诉讼。所以，官司会得到公正的解决。可见，官司若能得到公正的解决，除了你要有理之外，还在于遇到的法官是否公正。包公为秦香莲伸张正义，怒斩陈世美的故事，正是此爻爻义所在。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00935",
                "bodyParagraph": 871
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00938",
              "text": "上九。或锡之鞶带，终朝三褫之。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00938",
                "bodyParagraph": 874
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00939",
              "text": "象曰：以讼受服，亦不足敬也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00939",
                "bodyParagraph": 875
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00941",
              "text": "上九：王侯赐予人以绅带，但不满一天，三次赐予三次革夺。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00941",
                "bodyParagraph": 877
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00942",
              "text": "《象辞》说：某人因为讼事而得到赐予绅带的殊荣，这不是值得尊敬的事。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00942",
                "bodyParagraph": 878
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00944",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，会有争诉之忧，宜修德养身，化大为小。做官的会有成有败，患得患失。读书人认真学习，必可获佳绩。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00944",
                "bodyParagraph": 880
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00946",
              "text": "时运：患得患失，殊为不值。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00946",
                "bodyParagraph": 882
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00947",
              "text": "财运：不是正财，得不偿失。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00947",
                "bodyParagraph": 883
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00948",
              "text": "家宅：不易安居。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00948",
                "bodyParagraph": 884
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00949",
              "text": "身体：病势时好时坏，恐凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00949",
                "bodyParagraph": 885
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00951",
              "text": "上九爻动变得周易第47卦：泽水困。这个卦是异卦（下坎上兑）相叠。兑为阴为泽喻悦；坎为阳为水喻险。泽水困，陷入困境，才智难以施展，仍坚守正道，自得其乐，必可成事，摆脱困境。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00951",
                "bodyParagraph": 887
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00953",
              "text": "讼卦第六爻爻辞释义 锡：同“赐”，赐给。鞶带：大带，古代官服的一部分。褫：指剥去衣服。本爻的爻义是：或许受赐官服大带，但是一天之内被多次剥夺。我们的文化讲求的是“忍为贵，和为高”，占得此卦者，可能因为爱打官司，恃强争讼，结果得到了一定的好处，包括得到了升官的机会，穿上了官服，扎了大带，但是，这种做法因为违背了传统的文化而受到舆论的谴责，通过这种方式得官在别人看来也是不光彩的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00953",
                "bodyParagraph": 889
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00954",
              "text": "由于大家对你的评价不好，会影响上级对你的印像，你的官职可能是保不住的，甚至一天之内可能多次被剥掉官服，也就是被多次免职，职位不稳，非常危险。占得此爻者，当心有关换房、租房、提升、加薪等事，可能遭到三番五次的戏弄。当然，你要注意，不要对别人出尔反尔，不要戏弄别人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00954",
                "bodyParagraph": 890
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
